From 5b9c45774c574e100d86a7ef320e539865120b4c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Christopher A. Williamson" <contact@chrisaw.io>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 14:09:06 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/1] drop the virtualization apexes from the crates availability lists

the virtualization, compos and microfuchsia apexes are not built on the
gsi, so apex_available validation rejects the stale entries across the
crates that the virtualization tree used to consume.

Change-Id: I1d60235ca0638ed27e54d9fa38da3c57cdd94f54
